    Bug 1873179 - Account Hub show security warning when None is selected for connection security. r=aleca, arschmitz

    **How to Test**
    - Use test@example.com for the first step of the account hub
    - When redirected to the manual config, select "None" for connection security
    - The error text should be a clickable link that opens up the FAQ in your browser
    - It should be the same for outgoing in the manual setup
    - It should not prevent the user from continuing

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D236612

